# ST: Leaf x4 state gap {{[0-9]+}} stages 2 page 2 off chip
# MC: Leaf x4 state gap {{[0-9]+}} stages 4 multicycle 3 page 3 off chip
# WIN: Leaf off-chip page window 2
# CHECK-NOT: PROTOCOL
# CHECK: {{^}}MATCH 196 cycles
